YHWH Ya' Way — v1.0.0-beta.1  (first public beta)
=================================================

The semantic-version line above is read by the build scripts
(dev/build_dmg.sh, dev/installer.iss, dev/build_appimage.sh) and
by dev/generate_appcast.py. They consume the first non-blank line
only; everything below is human-readable metadata.

v1.0.0 ships:
  - 13 web consoles (note editor + matrix + sources + customize +
    publisher + audit + wizard + diff + compare + covers +
    preflight + ops + apihelp)
  - 9 built-in editions (ethiopian-tewahedo + catholic-study +
    evangelical-reformed + jewish-study + scholarly-academic +
    eastern-orthodox + anglican-bcp + lutheran-confessional +
    coptic-orthodox)
  - 7 starter-pack templates (cloned via the wizard's "Start from
    template" flow)
  - 51,394 notes across 87 books (corpus 2× the v1.0 floor)
  - Cross-denominational compare apparatus (ψ.8 — the v1.0
    differentiator)
  - Desktop binary chain (PyInstaller launcher + PyWebView shell +
    Sparkle/WinSparkle data plane + DMG/MSI/AppImage builders)
  - 11/11 invariant linter checks; 1048 tests

The "v1.0.0 ships" block above is the historical v1.0.0 release
manifest (tagged 2026-05-10). The project is now in v1.x, free-public
CC0 phase Ω.0 (post-pivot, non-commercial). Current corpus/edition/
test counts and the live roadmap live in dev/SESSION_STATE.md +
dev/CHANGELOG.md (not this file).

See dev/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.0.0.md for the full release notes and
dev/CHANGELOG.md for the chronological history.

